{"id":"steam-3808050","steam":3808050,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Hurricane.io","summary":"  is an online strategy game where you are the hurricane. Compete against real players from around the world to gain size and wind speed by absorbing clouds… or smaller hurricanes!","about":"///// GROW. SURVIVE. DESTROY!\n\n  is an online strategy game where you are the hurricane. You'll start as a tiny tropical storm, but by absorbing clouds you can get massive in no time.\n\nDestroying cities charges special powers, but you'll shrink while on land. Activate your powers at the perfect time to unleash chaos on the world ⁠— and the competition!\r\n\nThat's right. You're not the only cyclone around, and angering a bigger hurricane might get you eaten. But when you're a Perfect Storm, the whole sky is yours to devour!\n\nHow long can you survive? How big can you get? And how much destruction can you cause?","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808050/dc90359efd634a8103e73bbc347d7c6dd7feca9b/library_capsule.jpg?t=1755188794","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808050/74186b49ee66967ccbe43d5b2cd782fdbf92a320/header.jpg?t=1755188794","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808050/9de885106da4306b128e2409850039299e66c783/library_hero.jpg?t=1755188794","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808050/74186b49ee66967ccbe43d5b2cd782fdbf92a320/header.jpg?t=1755188794","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808050/e848516365d6e974daf59fcb4575a7f27d546f55/ss_e848516365d6e974daf59fcb4575a7f27d546f55.600x338.jpg?t=1755188794","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808050/e848516365d6e974daf59fcb4575a7f27d546f55/ss_e848516365d6e974daf59fcb4575a7f27d546f55.jpg?t=1755188794"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c